Rule 12 (input spatial dimensions must be greater than or equal to kernel size)
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : list(int), v_3 : str} |= if v_3 = "channels_last" then (shape(v_1, 1) ≥ v_2[0] ∧ shape(v_1, 2) ≥ v_2[1]) else (shape(v_1, 2) ≥ v_2[0] ∧ shape(v_1, 3) ≥ v_2[1])
>>
